## Global flags

Every command accepts:

| Flag | Description |
|---|---|
{{if eq .Tenancy "subdomain"}}| `--subdomain <name>` | Which logged-in subdomain to use (required when multiple are logged in). |
{{end}}| `--json` | Force JSON envelope output. |
| `--quiet` | Emit raw data only. Action commands print just the identifier; `delete` prints `success`. |
| `--toon` | TOON (Token-Optimized Output Notation) — compact format for LLMs. |
| `--verbose` | Expand every field of a record instead of a table. |

Commands refuse to run when a newer version has been released; run `{{.BinaryName}} update` to upgrade. Set `NEETO_SKIP_VERSION_CHECK=1` to bypass the check.
<!-- neeto-cli-commons:global-flags:end -->
